<!-- HERO -->
<header class="hero" id="top"><div class="hero-inner wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Finite state machines for Java</span>
  <h1>State machines that <span class="g">explain themselves</span>.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Finito is a lightweight, XML-driven state machine engine. Describe your workflow declaratively — states, events, transitions — and Finito runs it, generates a whole service from it, and draws the diagram for you in Mermaid and PlantUML.</p>
